      "start_line": 1860,
      "end_line": 1862,
      "text": "Exception: It is fine to set default values first, then specific values.\nHowever, it is preferred to do this work in a separate combinational block with\nexplicit blocking assignments.",
      "sha256": "95cb4e3e557c9542e94391c30886dee9c2e07f8caa40eafb0993a9810c70456d",
